          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha Baizuhaara, Kenaniya na batabani be, nubo baakomerwe kukorra Isirairi emirimo ey'aheeru, nk'emirimo ey'abanyoro n'abacwi b'emisango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha Bahebburooni, Hasabbiya na batabani be, abantu ab'amagezi orukumi rumu n'orusanju nubo baarolererraga Isirairi emirimo yoona eyakolerwaga MUKAMA n'okuheereza Omukama, Bugwaizooba bwa Yorudaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha Bahebburooni, Yeriya nuwe akaba ali mukuru wabu, obuzaale bwona obw'amaju ga baisenkurubo nkooku bukaba nibukuratana. Omumwaka ogw'amakumi ana ogw'engoma ya Daudi, nubwo baaserwiire abantu ab'amagezi mali omuli bo, bakazooka Yazeri omu rubuga Giryadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Daudi yamukoma hamu na beene baabo enkumi ibiri n'orusanju, abasaija ab'amagezi, abakuru b'amaju ga baisenkurubo, barolerrege Abarubbeni, Abagaadi, n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, okukora buli kintu kyona ekirukukwata hali Ruhanga, na ha mirimo y'omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
